WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.369
Pig looked for his friends.

2
00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:27.829
They were not at the pond.

3
00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:51.160
They were not in the barn.

4
00:00:51.161 --> 00:00:55.874
They were not behind the barn.

5
00:00:55.875 --> 00:01:05.580
They were not in the field.

6
00:01:05.581 --> 00:01:08.644
They were not at the house.

7
00:01:08.645 --> 00:01:15.798
Where were Pig's friends?

8
00:01:15.799 --> 00:01:22.343
Pig did not see them anywhere.

9
00:01:22.344 --> 00:01:24.910
"Oh!" said Pig.

10
00:01:24.911 --> 00:01:28.198
"They are playing a trick!

11
00:01:28.199 --> 00:01:32.836
They are playing a trick on me!

12
00:01:32.837 --> 00:01:36.291
They are mean!" said Pig.

13
00:01:36.292 --> 00:01:40.162
"I do not like this game anymore!"

14
00:01:40.163 --> 00:01:42.919
Pig was very sad.

15
00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:46.347
But he knew what to do.

16
00:01:46.348 --> 00:01:50.933
"I will eat something," said Pig.

17
00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:56.476
"Then I will feel better."

18
00:01:56.477 --> 00:02:00.334
So Pig ate and ate.

19
00:02:00.335 --> 00:02:05.122
He ate some more.

20
00:02:05.123 --> 00:02:08.248
Now Pig was very full.

21
00:02:08.249 --> 00:02:10.650
But he was still sad.

22
00:02:10.651 --> 00:02:13.344
Then Pig saw something.

23
00:02:13.345 --> 00:02:17.932
It was something shiny!

